ex items-center gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>NameVerse Editorial Team</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-700\">Read<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition group-hover:translate-x-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></div></div></article></div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div></div><footer class=\"border-t border-nv-border bg-nv-surface\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-nv-primary text-white shadow-sm\"><span class=\"text-xl font-black leading-none\">N</span></div><div><div class=\"text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-nv-text\">NameVerse</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-muted\">Meanings, origins &amp; guides</div></div></a><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-nv-text-secondary\">NameVerse helps parents and researchers discover baby names with meanings, cultural origins, linguistic context and trusted naming guidance.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-2\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/NameVerseOfficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border border-nv-border text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:border-nv-accent hover:bg-