</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border border-nv-border text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:border-nv-accent hover:bg-nv-accent-subtle hover:text-nv-accent\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></a></div></div><div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-nv-text\">By Religion</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/islamic/boy-names\">Islamic Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/islamic/boy-names\">Islamic Boy Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/islamic/girl-names\">Islamic Girl Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/christian/boy-names\">Christian Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/christian/boy-names\">Christian Boy Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/christian/girl-names\">Christian Girl Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/hindu/boy-names\">Hindu Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-text-secondary transition hover:text-nv-accent\" href=\"/hindu/boy-names\">Hindu Boy Names</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-nv-tex